---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const title = 'Privacy & Cookies'
const description =
  'How the RamosLabs Design System documentation site uses analytics cookies, what we collect, and how to opt out.'
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/privacy/">
  <article class="pv">
    <h1 class="pv__title">Privacy &amp; cookies</h1>
    <p class="pv__lead">
      This is the documentation site for the RamosLabs Design System. We use a small amount of
      privacy-conscious analytics to understand how the docs are used and make them better — nothing
      more. You are in control, and you can opt out at any time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pv__h2">What we use</h2>
    <ul class="pv__list">
      <li>
        <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — aggregate usage metrics (pages viewed, referrers,
        rough geography). We enable IP anonymization, so your full IP address is never stored.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> — anonymized heatmaps and session replays that show where
        people click and scroll. We enable text masking, so the content you see or type is never
        captured — only interaction patterns.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="pv__h2">Opt-out model</h2>
    <p class="pv__p">
      Analytics loads by default. The first time you visit, a notice tells you so and lets you
      <strong>Reject</strong> or <strong>Accept</strong>. If you reject, both trackers are disabled
      and their cookies are cleared from your browser. Your choice is remembered in a first-party
      cookie for about 180 days.
    </p>
    <p class="pv__p">
      Changed your mind? Use <button type="button" class="pv__inline-btn" data-rl-cookie-prefs
        >Cookie preferences</button
      > in the footer of any page to reopen the notice.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pv__h2">Cookies these tools set</h2>
    <p class="pv__p">
      When analytics is active: <code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>, <code>_gid</code> (Google
      Analytics), and <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code>, <code>CLID</code>,
      <code>ANONCHK</code> (Microsoft Clarity). We also set one first-party cookie,
      <code>rlds_consent</code>, to remember your choice. Rejecting clears the analytics cookies and
      stops new ones from being set.
    </p>

    <h2 class="pv__h2">Contact</h2>
    <p class="pv__p">
      This site is operated by RAMOS SOLUTIONS S.A.S. For privacy questions, reach us via
      <a class="pv__link" href="https://ramoslabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
        >ramoslabs.com</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .pv {
    max-width: 68ch;
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans, 'Rubik', system-ui, sans-serif);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .pv__title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-display, 'Red Hat Display', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }
  .pv__lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-8, 2rem);
  }
  .pv__h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-display, 'Red Hat Display', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: var(--space-8, 2rem) 0 var(--space-3, 0.75rem);
  }
  .pv__p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }
  .pv__list {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4, 1rem);
    padding-left: var(--space-5, 1.25rem);
  }
  .pv__list li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
  }
  .pv strong {
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pv code {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--color-surface-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs, 0.25rem);
    padding: 0.05em 0.4em;
  }
  .pv__link {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  /* Reuse the exact footer trigger from anywhere, styled as an inline link. */
  .pv__inline-btn {
    font: inherit;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .pv__inline-btn:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs, 0.25rem);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-focus);
  }
</style>
